    "body": "Problem:\nA count typed before a register name is applied twice to commands translated by `nv_optrans()` (x, X, D, C, s, S, `<Del>`): `2\"_x` deletes 4 characters, `2\"_D` deletes 4 lines. Since 2514256d95 executes stuffed keys eagerly, the nested `normal_cmd()` still sees the count saved by `nv_regname()` in `opcount` and multiplies it into the already-multiplied stuffed count.\n\nSolution:\nClear `opcount` (and `cap->opcount`) before executing the translated command.\n\nFixes #42468\n",
    "closed_at": null,
